  "oracle_text": "Flying\nWhen Silver Surfer enters, you may search your library for a card named Galactus, Devourer of Worlds, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\nWhenever Silver Surfer deals combat damage to a player, until the end of your next turn, target creature attacks that player each combat if able."
